Z||000002||theogre||02-21-2000||06:41 PM||||I take it that the damage is mostly suspension parts if your talking about moving body panels?<P>If that's all it is then most of the damage is bolt on parts. If you hang the motor from above you can change the whole cradle if need be without disconecting the engine from anyting but the bottom mounts.<P>If you damaged the main framing system, such as one of the strut towers, then moving the parts might be a good choice.||||reg||1
