Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||02-23-2000||07:55 PM||||I don't care for the notchback rear end, but the GTFX sold by Pisa does make it look like the fastback GTs (the top half at least). It actually looks a <B>LOT</B> better than the photos they show on the site. Dan-O did that conversion to his 85 GT, and it looked awesome!<P>Pics and a short article are on my site, under Exterior Modifications (in the Modifications section obviously)<P> <A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A> <P>Also check out the article on Fiero.net about converting a notchback SE to the fastback body.<P> <A HREF="http://fiero.net/showroom/fastback.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero.net/showroom/fastback.html</A> <P>p.s. the name's DARKlord, not dearlord.. lol.. j/k  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||3
